VCore treatment
---------------

The crate is distributed with VCore under the repository-root MIT `LICENSE`.
Material VCore changes include:

* bounded packet, accept, UDP, and application byte queues;
* a safe, capacity-limited application byte queue instead of an unsafe ring;
* one cancellable smoltcp driver with a synchronous stop barrier;
* configurable per-flow memory and timing limits;
* explicit resource counters and bounded backpressure;
* IPv4/IPv6 UDP emission through smoltcp wire representations;
* optional validated synthetic ICMPv4/ICMPv6 echo replies;
* dual-stack, pressure, shutdown, and packet-boundary tests.
